kground transitions.\n- Entry management requires explicit server capability; older API responses hide owner mutation controls. Source and automation-token lists, token revocation.\n- Honest unavailable states for unfinished connectors, invitations, incoming/unassigned feeds, creation flows and TOTP.\n\n## Verification\n- Eight unit tests pass locally.\n- Local browser regression with synthetic fixtures verifies search, retrieval, expiry, clearing, fail-closed controls, narrow widths and bottom-tab clearance.\n- No dependencies, deployment, real OAuth account/source connection, preferences persistence or analytics.\n\nThis is a development slice, not a complete initial product. Green currently shows explicitly retrieved codes, not a live incoming feed. README documents integration and remaining work.","closed_by":{"login":"abrahammurciano","id":25041135,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQxMTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25041135?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano","html_url":"https://github.com/abrahammurciano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abrahammurciano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otpanda/web/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"r